+// REGPU_LEAN_FETCH=2: what the fetch constant asks for is worked out on the CPU (renderer.cpp, tinfo.x bit 7:
+// a plain texture: no mirror, border, single-axis clamp, 16-bit fixed conversion, gamma, exponent, shader
